/-!
# Curvature generated by the primitive local Spin connection action

The primitive local Spin action writes the gravity connection by the
inhomogeneous law

`omega' = R omega R^-1 - dR R^-1`.

This module differentiates that actual write and proves covariance of the
full ordered mixed `gl(4)` curvature.  The transformed curvature is therefore
an output of the primitive connection dynamics; it is not copied from the
tensorial point-field action and no covariance receipt is supplied as an
input.
-/

